Third-party material
====================

The manuals in `motorola/` and the datasheets in `datasheets/` are
not part of this project, and the project's license does not apply to
them.  Each is the property of its
copyright holder.  They are included for reference because they are
the specification this software is written against: the code and
`PLAN.md` cite them by document and section.


No license to any of this material is granted or implied by its
presence here.

Motorola
--------

