Freescale and then NXP.  NXP no longer serves them at the addresses
below.  The reference manuals are NXP's own files as archived by the
Internet Archive (web.archive.org) on 2019-08-21; the user's manual
was copied from the smartclock project's `third_party/`
(github.com/charlieh0tel/smartclock).

